62    0    222    9    1375 6000 0    14    0    0    0    16    0   "Arial For CAE"   `This simulation computes the incident power into each component
at each frequency in the simulated spectrum.  See PCS_Rx_Bud_Power.dds
for these simulation results.  The transducer power gain from PORT1 to
pin 1 of each component is also simulated.  See PCS_Rx_Bud_Gain.dds for
these results.
Note that if the user wanted to see the gain to the input of each component
in the RX CHIP, then it would be necessary to remove this subcircuit 
and place all the subcircuit components directly on this schematic page.
  Also, note that the component instance names have been changed to
something more intuitive.
  For example, the PCS_diplexer is called "Diplexer" instead of
"X1".  Doing this makes it easier to keep track of the results in
the data display window. 
